{"id":"632815","name":"干萝卜丝馅包子","author":"兰杏梅","authorId":"12270318","desc":"","cover":"images/632815/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"干萝卜丝","amount":"一把"}],"sub":[{"name":"香葱","amount":"一把"},{"name":"酵母","amount":"少许"},{"name":"纯净水","amount":"少许(40以下)"},{"name":"炸好的粉条","amount":"少许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"干萝卜丝泡一夜。","img":"images/632815/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"切一下，备用。","img":"images/632815/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"炸好的粉条，捏段，备用。","img":"images/632815/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"切好的葱、粉条和萝卜丝放入盆中。","img":"images/632815/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加入适量盐、少许老抽、生抽、五香粉、鸡精、橄榄油和香油，搅拌均匀即可。","img":"images/632815/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"面粉中加少许酵母和温水，搅拌成絮状，醒发两倍大,揉成光滑面团。","img":"images/632815/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"搓成长条状,切成大小均匀的剂子。","img":"images/632815/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"擀成中间厚四周薄的包子皮。","img":"images/632815/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"包入馅料。","img":"images/632815/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"已包好。","img":"images/632815/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"冷水上笼。","img":"images/632815/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"大火烧开转中火蒸二十分钟，关火焖五分钟。","img":"images/632815/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"已蒸好。","img":"images/632815/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/632815/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"松软，掰开，香味扑鼻。","img":"images/632815/step_15.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}